    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the Monchling and hatch into the world not able to do too much.. But not to worry! You can consume creatures that have been distorted by a mysterious power and acquire abilities to help you through the journey ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079990/extras/a3d083c813bca6638f348f898fce7cb8.poster.avif?t=1747257365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079990/extras/a3d083c813bca6638f348f898fce7cb8.webm?t=1747257365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079990/extras/a3d083c813bca6638f348f898fce7cb8.mp4?t=1747257365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monch a variety of creatures to gain their abilities. Use them to navigate and interact with the world in new ways as you unlock and upgrade them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax while solving light puzzles and exploring a hand crafted open world full of chill vibes at your own pace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help out the cute locals as they try to deal with a curious infestation, and discover the ancient secrets hidden within this quaint world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is full of things to collect as you go so keep your eyes peeled!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079990/extras/1c191e75a31c9c7f6e1585bf63e8aa44.poster.avif?t=1747257365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079990/extras/1c191e75a31c9c7f6e1585bf63e8aa44.webm?t=1747257365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079990/extras/1c191e75a31c9c7f6e1585bf63e8aa44.mp4?t=1747257365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the Monchling and hatch into the world not able to do too much.. But not to worry! You can consume creatures that have been distorted by a mysterious power and acquire abilities to help you through the journey ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079990/extras/a3d083c813bca6638f348f898fce7cb8.poster.avif?t=1747257365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079990/extras/a3d083c813bca6638f348f898fce7cb8.webm?t=1747257365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079990/extras/a3d083c813bca6638f348f898fce7cb8.mp4?t=1747257365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monch a variety of creatures to gain their abilities. Use them to navigate and interact with the world in new ways as you unlock and upgrade them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax while solving light puzzles and exploring a hand crafted open world full of chill vibes at your own pace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help out the cute locals as they try to deal with a curious infestation, and discover the ancient secrets hidden within this quaint world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is full of things to collect as you go so keep your eyes peeled!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079990/extras/1c191e75a31c9c7f6e1585bf63e8aa44.poster.avif?t=1747257365\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079990/extras/1c191e75a31c9c7f6e1585bf63e8aa44.webm?t=1747257365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079990/extras/1c191e75a31c9c7f6e1585bf63e8aa44.mp4?t=1747257365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Absorb creatures to gain and upgrade abilities, relax as you explore a handcrafted world and help out it's inhabitants. Keep an eye out for trinkets and secrets as you investigate the strange power afflicting this place and it's denizens... What does it all mean?",
